      "requirement": "Preserve the Hooker incoming, Darwin reply and later receipt letter as separate documents. The 2181 body answers Darwin’s results and proposes additional volumes; 2182 explicitly requests more volumes and disagrees about general monographs; 2194 records that books arrived that morning. These are distinct response/receipt stages, with no automatic one-to-one prompt for every later paragraph.",
