  "global_rendering_rules": [
    "Keep body, headers, salutations, footnotes, annotations, scholarly sections, bibliography and enclosures as separate provenance layers.",
    "Use retained body paragraph numbering for semantic evidence and independent CSS DOM locators for raw markup; never substitute raw p indexes for retained numbering.",
    "Preserve MathML, stacked figures, table-like list order and literal transcription artifacts. Do not fill missing cells, fractions, words or alignment by inference.",
    "F suffix, catalogue summaries, packet inclusion and later publication cannot alone establish fragment extent, authorship, receipt, composition date or period eligibility.",
    "Actual figures must be separately preserved and viewed before describing visual content; an HTML template asset is not evidence of a source figure.",
    "This document is candidate-only formatting/chronology preparation and does not add, accept or recount relationships."
  ],
